#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:10 e7b4ee5a885c464697f3d44a986928cc
msgid ""
"A number of SkyRocket drones use ArduPilot as flight control software. This "
"page provides details for advanced users and potential developers on these "
"RTF drones."
msgstr "多款SkyRocket无人机使用ArduPilot作为飞控软件。本页面为高级用户和潜在开发者提供这些即飞无人机的详细信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:14 be543fadd9714da983401c2fc5885add
