msgstr "购买地点"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:18 6a7c0b23ccff436abd18df52520a42da
msgid ""
"The Journey drones that SkyRocket sells starting end of 2021 are not "
"supported by ArduPilot. See `this ArduPilot forum thread "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/is-the-sky-viper-journey-se-copter-"
"transmitter-pair-user-upgradeable-to-ardupilot/79275>`__."
msgstr ""
"SkyRocket从2021年底开始销售的Journey无人机不受ArduPilot支持。请参阅 `这个ArduPilot论坛帖子 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/is-the-sky-viper-journey-se-copter-"
"transmitter-pair-user-upgradeable-to-ardupilot/79275>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:22 8b80be4044594f59afb3c895bd989aba
msgid "**2017 models**"
msgstr "**2017年型号**"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:24 8813078c302c4074844e3dc81191ed2e
msgid ""
"The *Sky Viper v2450GPS Drone with Autopilot and GPS* is on sale through "
"`Walmart <https://www.walmart.com/ip/Sky-Viper-Streaming-Drone-with-"
"GPS/797973157>`__, `Amazon <https://www.amazon.com/Sky-Viper-v2450GPS-"
"Streaming-Autopilot/dp/B072HH13VQ/ref=lp_13203361011_1_6>`__ and Costco in "
"the US, Australia, Canada, Chile, France, German, Holland, Lithuania, "
"Mexico, New Zealand, Serbia, UK since October 2017."
msgstr ""
"*Sky Viper v2450GPS带飞控和GPS的无人机* "
"自2017年10月起通过美国、澳大利亚、加拿大、智利、法国、德国、荷兰、立陶宛、墨西哥、新西兰、塞尔维亚、英国的 `Walmart "
"<https://www.walmart.com/ip/Sky-Viper-Streaming-Drone-with-"
"GPS/797973157>`__、`Amazon <https://www.amazon.com/Sky-Viper-v2450GPS-"
"Streaming-Autopilot/dp/B072HH13VQ/ref=lp_13203361011_1_6>`__ 和Costco销售。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:26 e2547d5b7575489f928fdc79c82980a8
msgid ""
"SkyRocket sells a variety of different drones. Of the 2017 models, only the "
"V2450GPS Streaming drone (which will have a white shell) is capable of "
"running ArduPilot."
msgstr "SkyRocket销售各种不同的无人机。在2017年的型号中，只有V2450GPS流媒体无人机（白色外壳）能够运行ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:29 e06e8b67c2eb4453913b121b869de1d5
msgid "**2018 models**"
msgstr "**2018年型号**"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:31 d2120970d0264e9ba7821767df891286
msgid ""
"In August 2018, SkyRocket released three new ArduPilot powered drones, the "
"Fury, Scout, and Journey. The Fury and Scout utilize \"SurfaceScan\", built "
"on ArduPilot's OpticalFlow feature, to allow for indoor flight stability and"
" position holding, unprecedented in this price range. The Journey, with GPS "
"rather than OpticalFlow, takes lessons learned from the V2450GPS and builds "
"on those for a solid re-release for the full GPS-enabled ArduPilot "
"experience. The flight parameters and firmware for both the Scout and "
"Journey can be easily modified as the user sees fit through the embedded "
"wifi access point, powered by APWeb or using your favorite ground control "
"software. Much of the information on this page, which was written for the "
"V2450GPS, will at least partially apply to these new models, with updates "
"annotated as they are discovered."
msgstr ""
"2018年8月，SkyRocket发布了三款新的ArduPilot驱动无人机：Fury、Scout和Journey。Fury和Scout基于ArduPilot的光流功能采用\"SurfaceScan\"技术，支持室内飞行稳定和位置保持，在此价格区间前所未有。Journey配备GPS而非光流，汲取V2450GPS的经验教训，为完整GPS使能的ArduPilot体验带来了扎实的再发布。Scout和Journey的飞行参数及固件均可通过内置WiFi接入点使用APWeb或您喜爱的地面站软件轻松修改。本页面大部分为V2450GPS所写的信息，将至少部分适用于这些新型号，相关更新将随发现而标注。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:36 778a82f0a7324c62b0edac2e7a6111c6
msgid "**2021 models**"
msgstr "**2021年型号**"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:38 ae3f8878efa14eacad8b8f25d48c6661
msgid ""
"The Journey is not sold anymore. Instead a Sky Viper Journey SE is shipped. "
"Resellers might still have the Journey listed but have been observed to ship"
" the Journey SE."
msgstr ""
"Journey已停售，取而代之的是Sky Viper Journey SE。经销商可能仍列出Journey，但已观察到实际发货为Journey SE。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:42 3ac32b662e174d1ebd23387cae36317d
msgid "Discussion"
msgstr "讨论"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:44 28a6ccca06fb4529a05131e79858f8bd
msgid ""
"We have a `SkyViper section "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/skyviper>`__ on the ArduPilot "
"discussion forum. Have a look there to see what people are up to and ask "
"questions."
msgstr ""
"我们在ArduPilot讨论论坛上有一个 `SkyViper板块 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/skyviper>`__。欢迎查看其他人的动态并提问。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:46 27852df32a9e4754aea64db4dd73eaf9
msgid ""
"More developer specific information including how to compile the sonix and "
"ardupilot firmware can be found on the `developer wiki "
