#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:49 5d83dbec358a4a27be5ad2daddedbe3b
msgid "Toy Mode"
msgstr "玩具模式"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:51 d2edf1c354af490e983ad3989537bc1c
msgid ""
"The Skyviper has Toy Mode set by default. Toy Mode handles the following "
"functions, specific to the Sky Viper 2450GPS:"
msgstr "Skyviper默认启用玩具模式。玩具模式处理以下功能，专用于Sky Viper 2450GPS："

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:53 5729ab9eac634b3587250ffa96b24810
msgid "Handles the button presses from the transmitter"
msgstr "处理来自遥控器的按钮按下事件"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:54 a536eb67999148e89291e7eb1d010bcc
msgid "Magically trims the sticks when they're idle and the SV is disarmed"
msgstr "当摇杆空闲且SV已上锁时，自动调整摇杆微调"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:55 08cad8d2c564444694815a019bc440ae
msgid "Toggles the fence on and off depending on the situation"
msgstr "根据情况自动开启和关闭围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:56 4d84ad575138401892dcfa05ea9fa3f9
msgid ""
"Basically, if GPS is \"good\", the fence is armed, if GPS is \"not good\", "
"the fence is disarmed (for obvious reasons)"
msgstr "基本上，如果GPS\"良好\"，围栏开启；如果GPS\"不良好\"，围栏关闭（原因显而易见）"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:57 6361764da3414f7f9acc61e3638eb1c6
msgid ""
"Toy Mode also handles moving you between ALT_HOLD and LOITER automatically "
"depending on GPS Status."
msgstr "玩具模式还根据GPS状态自动在ALT_HOLD和Loiter之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:58 dcdf01d125314fd8875970c26f13990b
msgid "Handles the LED bling (source: peterbarker)"
msgstr "处理LED闪光效果（来源：peterbarker）"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:59 4b8bfc153acf4b06b10b8bad032b8db5
msgid "Toy Mode automatically adjusts the thrust based on voltage"
msgstr "玩具模式根据电压自动调整推力"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:60 869a33dfe762410b93f813106d4cc23a
msgid ""
"Toy Mode processes an arming script when armed using the throttle control to"
" prevent sudden climbs (idles motors for a moment before increasing speed)"
msgstr "玩具模式在使用油门控制解锁时执行解锁脚本，以防止突然爬升（在加速前让电机空转片刻）"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:61 6e65921d65ff4b088951ed83780d72b4
msgid "Performs some automatic Compass tuning if needed"
msgstr "如有需要，执行一些自动罗盘校准"

